{"detail": {"templateUuid": "a46736d7bb664453a3621d8bb3843696", "projectUuid": "a3e3fe674caf44e4a903392c0ed0b890", "name": "欢迎来到蔬菜小镇", "description": "每天傍晚，都会有一个世纪难题——今晚吃什么？\n女主走进超市，面对五颜六色、琳琅满目的蔬菜，再次陷入了选择困难。正当她犹豫不决时，一颗活泼的番茄突然眨了眨眼“活”了过来。\n\n为了帮助女主找到今晚的“最佳晚餐主角”，在番茄精灵的邀请下，女主意外缩小，踏入了一个充满惊喜的蔬菜小镇，正在展开趣味十足美食节。一路探索、一路欢笑，女主发现了每种蔬菜独特的魅力，也找到了今晚的“最佳晚餐主角”。", "coverUrl": "/assets/0ad5b1ae5cdb7fb6.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/f0de1895f3324e2bada3d1790c51c613/1cf6282829f189e06d2c655bba3f5af32a196713.mp4", "snapshotId": 24838, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 10010929, "ownerUuid": "f0de1895f3324e2bada3d1790c51c613", "avatar": "/assets/a17e316f3600c54c.webp", "nickname": "小谷同学", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 3, "tags": [{"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "createAt": "2026年07月07日 10:22", "updateAt": "2026年07月07日 10:54", "publishAt": "2026年07月07日 10:50", "playCount": 3, "viewCreationProcessCount": 1, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/a46736d7bb664453a3621d8bb3843696.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 134, "edges": 152}}, "recommendList": []}